From c7a32f5f3011fbb2d332bbcc592ad3de33b99003 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anthony Ruhier <aruhier@mailbox.org>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 01:50:01 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: x1e80100-lenovo-yoga-slim7x: wake on both
 lid edges

With the lid open, s2idle wakes up after almost exactly 300 s, reported
as a lid wake (gpio_keys, GPIO 92) although the lid did not move.

While suspended, the firmware leaves AOSD about every 300 s and goes
straight back, without Linux noticing. EV_ACT_DEASSERTED makes gpio-keys
switch the lid IRQ to rising edge only at suspend. With the PDC in
pass-through mode, the line it drives to the GIC is the pin level,
inverted for falling edge. Whenever that line is high and the pin has a
single-edge type, the AOSD exit produces a lid interrupt that wakes the
system. With both edges, the line is just as high with the lid open, but
no interrupt is produced. So the event comes from the always-on side
(the PDC or the firmware), not from the GIC.

Measured on a Yoga Slim 7x:
- rising only, lid open: wakes after 5:02 (AOSD stint 299.1 s)
- rising only, lid closed: sleeps (15 AOSD stints over 73 min)
- falling only, lid open: sleeps (9.5 min)
- falling only, lid closed: wakes after 5:02 with the lid shut
- both edges, lid open or closed: sleeps, wakes on lid open

Drop wakeup-event-action to keep the lid IRQ on both edges through
suspend. This matches Windows: the DSDT of this machine arms the lid as
GpioInt (Edge, ActiveBoth, SharedAndWake) on GPIO 92, and Windows does
not false-wake in Modern Standby, with the lid open or closed.

Closing the lid of a system suspended with the lid open now wakes it
too; logind then suspends it again after its lid holdoff.

Fixes: 7069abcd5340 ("arm64: dts: qcom: x1e80100-lenovo-yoga-slim7x: Add lid switch")
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: Anthony Ruhier <aruhier@mailbox.org>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x1e80100-lenovo-yoga-slim7x.dts | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x1e80100-lenovo-yoga-slim7x.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x1e80100-lenovo-yoga-slim7x.dts
index 68864a294b2d8..558e3fe1f94e1 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x1e80100-lenovo-yoga-slim7x.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x1e80100-lenovo-yoga-slim7x.dts
@@ -38,7 +38,6 @@
 			linux,input-type = <EV_SW>;
 			linux,code = <SW_LID>;
 			wakeup-source;
-			wakeup-event-action = <EV_ACT_DEASSERTED>;
 		};
 	};
 
